痛快。如快剑斫阵，强弩射千里，所当穿彻，善书家笔势，亦穷於此，然亦似仲由未见孔子时风气耳。回旋曲折，气古而韵高，于侧掠，掣趨，劲循，古法，度无一笔妄作。而墨在毫中，挤于纸上，浓淡重轻，亦依稀若见。", "quality": "blurry", "img": "imgs/20351/米芾.png", "mask": "", "bbox": {"w": 150, "h": 219}}, {"master": "颜真卿", "script": "楷书", "dynasty": "唐", "source": "碑", "stroke_style": null, "structure": null, "desc": null, "quality": "ccd", "img": "imgs/20351/颜真卿.png", "mask": "", "bbox": {"w": 137, "h": 107}}, {"master": "张即之", "script": "楷书", "dynasty": "宋", "source": "墨", "stroke_style": null, "structure": null, "desc": null, "quality": "ccd", "img": "imgs/20351/张即之.png", "mask": "", "bbox": {"w": 138, "h": 123}}, {"master": "智永", "script": "楷书", "dynasty": "隋", "source": "墨", "stroke_style": null, "structure": null, "desc": null, "quality": "ccd", "img": "imgs/20351/智永.png", "mask": "", "bbox": {"w": 138, "h": 117}}, {"master": "柳公权", "script": "楷书", "dynasty": "唐", "source": "碑", "stroke_style": null, "structure": null, "desc": null, "quality": "ccd", "img": "imgs/20351/柳公权.png", "mask": "", "bbox": {"w": 138, "h": 109}}, {"master": "沈尹默", "script": "楷书", "dynasty": "民国", "source": "墨", "stroke_style": null, "structure": null, "desc": null, "quality": "ccd", "img": "imgs/20351/沈尹默.png", "mask": "", "bbox": {"w": 138, "h": 116}}, {"master": "赵之谦", "script": "楷书", "dynasty": "清", "source": "墨", "stroke_style": null, "structure": null, "desc": null, "quality": "ccd", "img": "imgs/20351/赵之谦.png", "mask": "", "bbox": {"w": 138, "h": 99}}, {"master": "赵孟頫", "script": "楷书", "dynasty": "元", "source": "墨", "stroke_style": null, "structure": null, "desc": null, "quality": "ccd", "img": "imgs/20351/赵孟頫.png", "mask": "", "bbox": {"w": 138, "h": 108}}]}